# Quality gates

Do not omit a listed app. Missing tooling is implementation work, not a skip.

## Listed full gates (implementer, once)

Run each listed target **once**, **sequentially**, before calling the work done.

- Pharmacy: `cd namma-pharmacy && npm run typecheck && npm run build`.
- Website: `cd medmate-website && SITE_URL=https://medmatepharmacy.com npm run build`.
- Compose: `make compose-config`.

Do not mark the change done while a listed full gate is red.
